.
.  Create a GIF file for a run sequence plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
set ipl1na runseq.ps
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ MAVRO.DAT Y
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL Index
Y1LABEL Transmittance
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 10
CHARACTER X
LINE BLANK
.
PLOT Y
.
BOX 0 0 100 100
.
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
system mv RUNSEQ.PS runseq.ps
QUIT
